From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 15:58:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Complete threaded Durable Object lifecycle transitions

Park upgraded sockets before retiring homes with ordinary transports or expired work. Account for WebSocket pumps separately from application blockers, resolve timed-out parking against the WAL open, and retry failed control connections. End retained native sessions and report forced resets without replacing responsive durable processes.

